  "description": "\ud83e\udde9 Asset Name: Special Assassin Rigged Animated\r\n\u26a1 Type: Realistic \u2013 Low-poly\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Style: Realistic \r\n\ud83d\udcdd Description:\r\nThis is a low-poly .\r\nIt is optimized for real-time use in games, VR, and animation projects.\r\nThe design is stylized but with enough detail to work well in both cinematic and gameplay contexts.\r\nReady to import into Unity, Unreal Engine, and Blender.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Technical Details:\r\nthe animations has been stashed in Action editor (blend file).\r\n- Polycount: 7.541\r\n- Rig: Yes (basic humanoid rig)\r\n- UVs: Unwrapped / Non-overlapping\r\n- Textures: 4K PBR (Base Color, Normal, Roughness, Metallic, Hight, Ambient Occlusion)\r\n- Materials: 2 main material",
